{"thought": "The morning proposal to Felix is behind a card, so I report it to Bob, read back the hard line, and confirm what I took from his ask.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Got your note that it's mornings only for this one, so I've put that on the plan as a hard line: nothing after 12:00. The ask I'm working from is 45 minutes on a Meet link, the week of December 7, now mornings only.\n\nFelix hasn't replied to the first three times yet, and two of those were afternoons, so I've drafted a fresh set for him. The card as drafted goes to Felix with you in cc and offers Monday Dec 7 at 9:45am, Wednesday Dec 9 at 9:30am, and Friday Dec 11 at 10:45am, with a line saying your afternoons next week have filled up so these are morning options instead. Approve sends it."}}

{"thought": "Bob's afternoons next week are gone, so the two afternoon slots already with Felix are dead; I'll re-offer the morning he already has plus two new mornings. Felix has no recorded no, so this is plain first wording."}

