{"thought": "Two of the three times Felix holds are afternoons, which Bob's new morning-only line rules out, so I'll offer him the morning he already has plus two new mornings from Bob's free list.", "tool": "propose", "args": {"to": ["felix.oyelaran@brightwater.example.net"], "slots": [822, 824, 827], "note": "Bob's afternoons that week have filled up, so these are all mornings."}}

{"thought": "The new morning proposal is carded; now tell Bob what it says, read back the hard line, and note the plan basics so he can catch a misread.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Noted your line as a hard one: nothing after 12:00 that week, mornings only. The earlier note to Felix Oyelaran had two afternoons in it, so I've replaced them.

For the supplier review I'm working to 45 minutes on a Meet link, the week of December 7. Your mornings that week have three clear slots: Monday the 7th at 9:45, Tuesday the 8th at 9:45, and Wednesday the 9th at 9:30.

The card as drafted is a note to Felix with those three mornings, you in cc, introducing me as your assistant agent, with a line saying your afternoons that week have filled up so here are three mornings instead. Approve sends it. He hasn't written back on the thread yet, so after that it's his reply we're waiting on."}}
